The '''{{Pink|Baking Specialist}}''' was an [[NPC]] who appeared during SkyBlock Years 144-146 (from June 23rd to July 4th, 2021). They handed out the Year 143 {{Item|New Year Cake}}, due to Hypixel being in maintenance mode during the [[New Year Celebration]] of that year. During the [[New Year Celebration]] of Year 144 and 145, both the {{NPCSprite|Baker}} and '''Baking Specialist''' appeared.

